From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] generator: braces around the key map update

Without them, the length was also written for unmapped keys (id -1),
i.e. to key_map[-1].
---
 generator.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/generator.c b/generator.c
--- a/generator.c
+++ b/generator.c
@@ -44,9 +44,10 @@ void generate_map()
 			continue;
 
 		while ((key = group->keys[key_index++]).len) {
-			if (key.id != -1)
+			if (key.id != -1) {
 				key_map[key.id].id = entry->addr + size;
 				key_map[key.id].len = key.len;
+			}
 
 			size += key.len;
 		}
